<title>USA: United Foods makes 1 mln-share tender offer.</title>
<headline>United Foods makes 1 mln-share tender offer.</headline>
<dateline>BELLS, Tenn. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Foods Inc said on Monday it will begin a cash tender offer for up to one million shares of its Class A and Class B common stock at a price of $2.50 per share.</p>
<p>The offer will expire at 1700 EDT/2100 GMT on June 17 and the company will treat both classes of stock equally for the purposes of the offer, United Foods said in a statement.</p>
</text>
